---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`${SITE_NAMES[lang]} legal notice: publisher, host and terms of use 2026`} description="Publisher and host of SSB T-bill, an independent site not affiliated with MAS, the CPF Board or IRAS; calculations are general information, not financial or tax advice." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Legal notice and terms of use</h1>
    <p>Information given under Article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004, the publisher being established in France.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Independent site</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAMES[lang]} is a private publication. It is not run, endorsed or paid for by the Monetary Authority of Singapore, the Central Provident Fund Board, the Inland Revenue Authority of Singapore, the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation, the Singapore Government, a bank, a broker or a financial adviser. It holds no licence under the Securities and Futures Act or the Financial Advisers Act and gives no financial advice.</p>
    <h2>General information, not advice</h2>
    <p>The pages describe the published rules of Savings Bonds, T-bills, deposits, SRS and CPF, and the calculators apply them to the figures you type. Nothing here is personal financial, tax, legal or investment advice, or a recommendation to buy, hold or redeem a bond, a bill or a deposit, or to top up CPF. What MAS, CDP, your bank or the CPF Board credits is the figure that counts.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2><p>Rules and rates are read on official texts and the calculators are tested before each release, but rules change and errors cannot be excluded. The publisher is not liable for a decision taken on the basis of the site alone. Errors can be reported through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Texts, design and code belong to the publisher; short quotations with a link are welcome. MAS datasets are used under the MAS Terms of Use of Datasets (Singapore Open Data Licence version 1.0), with the attribution given on the About page; they remain the property of MAS.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The comparison calculator may be embedded for free with its credit line visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Reporting unlawful content</h2><p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the page address.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law applies; failing an amicable settlement, the courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction} have jurisdiction. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
